,"Поддержка апгрейдов и даунгрейдов","Автоматическое отмены платежей","Интеграция с API Stripe","Поддержка уже существующих кредитных карт"],"ar":["دفع آلي مع سترايب","دعم الترقية والترقية العكسية","إلغاء دفع آلي","دمج مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب","دعم البطاقات الائتمانية الحالية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use autumn-add-payments","autumn-add-payments setup guide","autumn-add-payments alternative","autumn-add-payments vs Stripe","autumn-add-payments install","what is autumn-add-payments","autumn-add-payments API documentation","autumn-add-payments Stripe integration"],"zh":["Autumn Payments","AIエージェント支付","Stripe checkout","支付流程自动化","升级、降级和取消","card already on file","attach功能"],"ja":["Autumn Payments","AIエージェントによるストライプ決済","Stripeのチェックアウト","支払いプロセス自動化","アップグレード、ダウングレード、キャンセル","card already on file","attach機能"],"ko":["Autumn Payments","AI 에이전트를 이용한 스트라이프 결제","스트라이프 체크아웃","결제 프로세스 자동화","업그레이드, 다운그레이드, 취소","card already on file","attach 기능"],"es":["autumn-add-payments","pagos automáticos","Stripe checkout","integración de pagos","automatización de pagos","gestión de pagos","herramientas de pago","soluciones de pago","desarrollo de pagos"],"fr":["autumn-add-payments","paiements automatisés","checkout Stripe","intégration de paiement","automatisation de paiement","gestion de paiement","outils de paiement","solutions de paiement","développement de paiement"],"de":["autumn-add-payments","automatisierte Zahlungen","Stripe-Checkout","Zahlungsintegration","Zahlungsautomatisierung","Zahlungsverwaltung","Zahlungstools","Zahlungslösungen","Zahlungsentwicklung"],"pt":["autumn add payments","stripe checkout","pagamento automático","integração com stripe","checkout api","pagamento com cartão de crédito","como configurar autumn add payments"],"ru":["autumn add payments","stripe checkout","автоматический платеж","интеграция со stripe","api checkout","оплата картой кредит","настройка autumn add payments"],"ar":["أداة秋يضاف المدفوعات","دفع سترايب","دفع آلي","دمج مع سترايب","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الدفع","دفع bằng بطاقة ائتمانية","كيفية إعداد أداة秋يضاف المدفوعات"]}},"owner":"usenotra","repo":"notra","repoPath":"usenotra/notra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.326Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"autumn-add-payments","description":"Skill for adding Stripe checkout and payment flows using Autumn.","bodyPreview":"# Autumn Payments\n\n**Always consult [docs.useautumn.com](https://docs.useautumn.com) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nAutumn handles Stripe checkout, upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Payment Flow\n1. `checkout` - Returns Stripe URL (new) or preview data (returning customer)\n2. `attach` - Confirms purchase when card already on file\n\n### Checkout Result\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `url` | Stripe checkout URL (null if car","body":"# Autumn Payments\n\n**Always consult [docs.useautumn.com](https://docs.useautumn.com) for code examples and latest API.**\n\nAutumn handles Stripe checkout, upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Payment Flow\n1. `checkout` - Returns Stripe URL (new) or preview data (returning customer)\n2. `attach` - Confirms purchase when card already on file\n\n### Checkout Result\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `url` | Stripe checkout URL (null if card on file) |\n| `product` | Target product with scenario |\n| `current_product` | Customer''s current product |\n| `lines` | Invoice line items |\n| `total` | Amount in major currency units |\n| `currency` | Currency code |\n\n---\n\n## Product Scenarios\n\n| Scenario | Meaning | Action |\n|----------|---------|--------|\n| `new` | Not subscribed | Subscribe |\n| `active` | Current plan | Current Plan |\n| `scheduled` | Scheduled | Already Scheduled |\n| `upgrade` | Higher tier | Upgrade |\n| `downgrade` | Lower tier | Downgrade |\n| `renew` | Cancelled | Renew |\n\n---\n\n## React Implementation\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCustomer, usePricingTable } from \"autumn-js/react\";\n\nconst { checkout, attach } = useCustomer();\nconst { products } = usePricingTable();\n\n// Checkout flow\nconst data = await checkout({ productId: \"pro\" });\nif (data.url) {\n  window.location.href = data.url;  // New customer\n} else {\n  // Show confirmation dialog, then:\n  await attach({ productId: \"pro\" });\n}\n\n// Cancel\nconst { cancel } = useCustomer();\nawait cancel({ productId: \"pro\" });\n// Or downgrade to free:\nawait attach({ productId: \"free\" });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Backend Implementation\n\n```typescript\nimport { Autumn } from \"autumn-js\";\n\nconst autumn = new Autumn({ secretKey: process.env.AUTUMN_SECRET_KEY });\n\n// Checkout\nconst { data } = await autumn.checkout({ customer_id, product_id: \"pro\" });\nif (data.url) return redirect(data.url);\n\n// Attach (after user confirms)\nawait autumn.attach({ customer_id, product_id: \"pro\" });\n\n// Get products with scenarios\nconst { data: productsData } = await autumn.products.list({ customer_id });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prepaid Pricing\n\nFor seat-based or prepaid products, pass quantities:\n\n```typescript\nawait autumn.checkout({\n  customer_id,\n  product_id: \"credits_pack\",\n  options: [{ feature_id: \"credits\", quantity: 500 }],\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Button Text Pattern\n\n```typescript\nfunction getButtonText(product: Product): string {\n  const { scenario, properties } = product;\n  if (properties?.has_trial) return \"Start Trial\";\n  if (scenario === \"active\") return \"Current Plan\";\n  \n  const text = { upgrade: \"Upgrade\", downgrade: \"Downgrade\", new: \"Subscribe\" };\n  return text[scenario] ?? \"Enable\";\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **URL field** - It''s `data.url`, not `data.checkout_url`\n2. **Don''t build custom logic** - Use `products.list` for scenarios\n3. **Proration automatic** - Autumn handles upgrade/downgrade proration\n4. **Cancel via free** - Prefer attaching free plan over hard cancel\n5. **Success URL** - Pass `success_url` to redirect after Stripe checkout\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Checkout Docs](https://docs.useautumn.com/api-reference/core/checkout)\n- [Attach Docs](https://docs.useautumn.com/api-reference/core/attach)\n- [LLMs.txt](https://docs.useautumn.com/llms.txt)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:03.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for SaaS Builder Agents automating Stripe payment flows and subscription management.","zh":"对于自动化 Stripe 支付流程和订阅管理的 SaaS Builder Agents 至关重要。","ja":"Stripe の支払いフローとサブスクリプション管理を自動化する SaaS Builder Agents に不可欠です。","ko":"Stripe 결제 플로우와 구독 관리를 자동화하는 SaaS Builder Agents에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de construcción de SaaS que automatizan flujos de pago de Stripe y administración de suscripciones.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de construction de SaaS qui automatisent les flux de paiement Stripe et la gestion des abonnements.","de":"Wichtig für SaaS-Builder-Agents, die Stripe-Zahlungsflüsse und Abonnementsverwaltung automatisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Construtores de SaaS que automatizam fluxos de pagamento do Stripe e gerenciamento de assinaturas.","ru":"Необходим для агентов-строителей SaaS, автоматизирующих потоки оплаты Stripe и управление подписками.","ar":"ضروري لموظفي بناء SaaS الذين يautomate تدفقات الدفع Stripe وإدارة الاشتراك"},"recommendation":{"en":"Automates the complete Stripe payment lifecycle, including checkout session generation, subscription upgrades, downgrades, and cancellations. Provides a seamless integration for handling both new customer checkout URLs and returning customer preview data through the attach method.","zh":"自动化完整的 Stripe 支付生命周期，包括结账会话生成、订阅升级、降级和取消。通过 attach 方法为新客户结账 URL 和现有客户的预览数据处理提供无缝集成。","ja":"チェックアウトセッションの生成、サブスクリプションのアップグレード、ダウングレード、キャンセルを含む、完全な Stripe 支払いライフサイクルを自動化します。attach メソッドを通じて、新規顧客のチェックアウト URL と既存顧客のプレビューデータの両方を処理するためのシームレスな統合を提供します。","ko":"체크아웃 세션 생성, 구독 업그레이드, 다운그레이드 및 취소를 포함한 완전한 Stripe 결제 수명 주기를 자동화합니다. attach 메서드를 통해 신규 고객 체크아웃 URL과 기존 고객 미리보기 데이터를 모두 처리하기 위한 원활한 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Automatiza el ciclo de vida de pago de Stripe completo, incluyendo la generación de sesiones de checkout, actualizaciones de suscripción, degradaciones y cancelaciones. Proporciona una integración sin problemas para manejar tanto las URLs de checkout de nuevos clientes como los datos de vista previa de clientes que regresan a través del método de adjuntar.","fr":"Automatise le cycle de vie de paiement Stripe complet, y compris la génération de sessions de checkout, les mises à niveau d''abonnement, les dégradations et les annulations. Fournit une intégration transparente pour gérer à la fois les URL de checkout des nouveaux clients et les données d''aperçu des clients qui reviennent via la méthode d''attachement.","de":"Automatisiert den gesamten Stripe-Zahlungslebenszyklus, einschließlich der Erstellung von Checkout-Sitzungen, Abonnements-Upgrades, Downgrades und Stornierungen. Bietet eine nahtlose Integration, um sowohl die Checkout-URLs neuer Kunden als auch die Vorschau-Daten zurückkehrender Kunden über die Attach-Methode zu verarbeiten.","pt":"Automatiza o ciclo de vida completo de pagamento do Stripe, incluindo geração de sessão de checkout, upgrade de assinatura, downgrade e cancelamento. Fornece uma integração transparente para lidar com URLs de checkout de novos clientes e dados de visualização de clientes retornados por meio do método de anexação.","ru":"Автоматизирует полный цикл оплаты Stripe, включая создание сессии оплаты, обновление подписки, понижение и отмену. Обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию для обработки как новых, так и существующих клиентов через метод attach.","ar":"يؤتمة دورة حياة الدفع الكاملة Stripe، بما في ذلك إنشاء جلسة الدفع وترقية الاشتراك والخفض والإلغاء. يوفر تكاملًا موحدًا لمعالجة عناوين URL للعملاء الجدد ومعاينة بيانات العملاء العائدين من خلال طريقة附Peripheral"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Stripe checkout session creation","Handling subscription upgrades and downgrades","Processing customer cancellations","Managing returning customer payments with card on file"],"zh":["自动化 Stripe 结账会话创建","处理订阅升级和降级","处理客户取消","管理使用存档卡片的现有客户付款"],"ja":["Stripe チェックアウトセッション作成の自動化","サブスクリプションのアップグレードとダウングレードの処理","顧客キャンセルの処理","登録済みカードによる既存顧客の支払い管理"],"ko":["Stripe 체크아웃 세션 생성 자동화","구독 업그레이드 및 다운그레이드 처리","고객 취소 처리","파일에 카드가 등록된 기존 고객 결제 관리"],"es":["Creación automática de sesiones de checkout de Stripe","Control de actualizaciones y degradaciones de suscripción","Procesamiento de cancelaciones de clientes","Gestión de pagos de clientes que regresan con tarjeta en archivo"],"fr":["Création automatique de sessions de checkout Stripe","Gestion des mises à niveau et des dégradations d''abonnement","Traitement des annulations de clients","Gestion des paiements de clients qui reviennent avec carte en fichier"],"de":["Automatisierte Erstellung von Stripe-Checkout-Sitzungen","Verwaltung von Abonnements-Upgrades und Downgrades","Verarbeitung von Kundenstornierungen","Verwaltung von Zahlungen zurückkehrender Kunden mit Karte im Archiv"],"pt":["Criação automática de sessão de checkout do Stripe","Manuseio de upgrades e downgrades de assinatura","Processamento de cancelamentos de clientes","Gerenciamento de pagamentos de clientes retornados com cartão em arquivo"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание сессии оплаты Stripe","Обработка апгрейдов и даунгрейдов подписки","Обработка отмен клиентов","Управление платежами возвращенных клиентов с картой на файле"],"ar":["إنشاء جلسة دفع Stripe تلقائي","معالجة ترقية وخفض الاشتراك","معالجة إلغاء العملاء","إدارة مدفوعات العملاء العائدين مع بطاقة في الملف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stripe integration","Dependent on Autumn API documentation for latest implementation details"],"zh":["需要集成 Stripe","依赖 Autumn API 文档以获取最新的实现细节"],"ja":["Stripe の統合が必要","最新の実装詳細については Autumn API ドキュメントに依存"],"ko":["Stripe 통합이 필요함","최신 구현 세부사항은 Autumn API 문서에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con Stripe","Dependiente de la documentación de la API de Autumn para los detalles de implementación más recientes"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Stripe","Dépend de la documentation de l''API Autumn pour les détails d''implémentation les plus récents"],"de":["Benötigt Stripe-Integration","Abhängig von der Autumn-API-Dokumentation für die neuesten Implementierungsdetails"],"pt":["Requer integração do Stripe","Dependente da documentação da API do Autumn para detalhes de implementação mais recentes"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Stripe","Зависит от документации API Autumn для последних деталей реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل Stripe","يعتمد على توثيق API Autumn لأحدث تفاصيل التنفيذ"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"343037643cb5ac60e074de749b64ea45dd3dd2edce8cfe4f8cf4ad772bb98bff","qualityScore":36}');
