및 확장을 지원하는 프로덕션 준비 풀스택 템플릿입니다","es":"Anuncios pagados son campañas publicitarias en línea que utilizan tecnologías como Next.js y FastAPI para atraer clientes","fr":"Les annonces payantes sont des campagnes publicitaires en ligne qui utilisent des technologies comme Next.js et FastAPI pour attirer des clients","de":"Bezahlte Anzeigen sind Online-Werbkampagnen, die Technologien wie Next.js und FastAPI nutzen, um Kunden anzuziehen","pt":"O que é anúncios pagos? É um modelo de marketing de desempenho que ajuda a criar e otimizar anúncios pagos.","ru":"Что такое платная реклама? Это модель маркетинга производительности, которая помогает создавать и оптимизировать платные рекламные кампании.","ar":"ما هي الإعلانات المدفوعة؟ إنها نموذج تسويق الأداء الذي يساعد على إنشاء وحسابة الإعلانات المدفوعة."},"features":{"en":["Includes Next.js for server-side rendering and static site generation","Utilizes FastAPI for building high-performance APIs","Supports Flutter for cross-platform mobile app development","Integrates Terraform for infrastructure as code management","References mise for additional development tools and services"],"zh":["包含 Next.js 和 FastAPI 的生产就绪全栈模板","支持 Flutter 和 Terraform","使用 mise 进行高效的付费广告活动创建","优化和扩展付费广告活动","直接访问广告平台账户"],"ja":["Next.js と FastAPI を含むプロダクションレディフルスタックテンプレート","Flutter と Terraform をサポート","mise を使用した効率的な有料広告キャンペーンの作成","有料広告キャンペーンの最適化と拡張","広告プラットフォームアカウントへの直接アクセス"],"ko":["Next.js 및 FastAPI를 포함하는 프로덕션 준비 풀스택 템플릿","Flutter 및 Terraform 지원","mise를 사용한 효율적인 유료 광고 캠페인의 생성","유료 광고 캠페인의 최적화 및 확장","광고 플랫폼 계정への 직접 액세스"],"es":["Plantilla de monorepo fullstack con Next.js","Integración con FastAPI para optimizar campañas","Compatibilidad con Flutter para aplicaciones móviles","Gestión de infraestructura con Terraform","Otimización de anuncios con mise"],"fr":["Modèle de monorepo fullstack avec Next.js","Intégration avec FastAPI pour optimiser les campagnes","Compatibilité avec Flutter pour les applications mobiles","Gestion de l''infrastructure avec Terraform","Optimisation des annonces avec mise"],"de":["Fullstack-Monorepo-Vorlage mit Next.js","Integration mit FastAPI zur Optimierung von Kampagnen","Kompatibilität mit Flutter für Mobile-Anwendungen","Infrastrukturverwaltung mit Terraform","Optimierung von Anzeigen mit mise"],"pt":["Integração com Next.js para desenvolvimento web","Uso de FastAPI para criar APIs de backend","Suporte a Flutter para desenvolvimento móvel","Gerenciamento de infraestrutura com Terraform","Otimização de anúncios com mise"],"ru":["Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для автоматизации рекламных кампаний","Использование Terraform для управления инфраструктурой","Поддержка FastAPI для создания бэкенд-API","Разработка мобильных приложений с помощью Flutter","Оптимизация рекламных кампаний с помощью mise"],"ar":["دمج Next.js لتطوير الويب","استخدام FastAPI لإنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخلفية","دعم Flutter لتطوير الهاتف المحمول","إدارة البنية التحتية مع Terraform","تحسين الإعلانات مع mise"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use paid-ads","paid-ads vs competitors","paid-ads install guide","what is paid-ads","paid-ads setup tutorial","paid-ads alternative solutions","paid-ads and Next.js","paid-ads and FastAPI","paid-ads for customer acquisition"],"zh":["paid-ads","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","付费广告","全栈模板","生产就绪"],"ja":["paid-ads","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","有料広告","フルスタックテンプレート","プロダクションレディ"],"ko":["paid-ads","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","유료 광고","풀스택 템플릿","프로덕션 준비"],"es":["anuncios pagados","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","publicidad en línea","campañas publicitarias","optimización de anuncios"],"fr":["annonces payantes","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","publicité en ligne","campagnes publicitaires","optimisation des annonces"],"de":["bezahlte Anzeigen","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","Online-Werbung","Werbkampagnen","Anzeigenoptimierung"],"pt":["anúncios pagos","marketing de desempenho","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","monorepo fullstack","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento móvel"],"ru":["платная реклама","маркетинг производительности","ИИ Агенты","Terraform","FastAPI","Flutter","mise","monorepo fullstack","разработка веб-приложений","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["الإعلانات المدفوعة","تسويق الأداء","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","monorepo كامل","تطوير الويب","تطوير الهاتف المحمول"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.327Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paid-ads","description":"When the user wants help with paid advertising campaigns on Google Ads, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, Twitter/X, or other ad platforms. Also use when the user mentions PPC, paid media, ad copy, ad creative, ROAS, CPA, ad campaign, retargeting, or audience targeting. This skill covers campaign strategy, ad creation, audience targeting, and optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):","body":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Campaign Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Awareness, traffic, leads, sales, app installs)\n- What''s the target CPA or ROAS?\n- What''s the monthly/weekly budget?\n- Any constraints? (Brand guidelines, compliance, geographic)\n\n### 2. Product & Offer\n- What are you promoting? (Product, free trial, lead magnet, demo)\n- What''s the landing page URL?\n- What makes this offer compelling?\n\n### 3. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem does your product solve for them?\n- What are they searching for or interested in?\n- Do you have existing customer data for lookalikes?\n\n### 4. Current State\n- Have you run ads before? What worked/didn''t?\n- Do you have existing pixel/conversion data?\n- What''s your current funnel conversion rate?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Use When |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Google Ads** | High-intent search traffic | People actively search for your solution |\n| **Meta** | Demand generation, visual products | Creating demand, strong creative assets |\n| **LinkedIn** | B2B, decision-makers | Job title/company targeting matters, higher price points |\n| **Twitter/X** | Tech audiences, thought leadership | Audience is active on X, timely content |\n| **TikTok** | Younger demographics, viral creative | Audience skews 18-34, video capacity |\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Structure Best Practices\n\n### Account Organization\n\n```\nAccount\n├── Campaign 1: [Objective] - [Audience/Product]\n│   ├── Ad Set 1: [Targeting variation]\n│   │   ├── Ad 1: [Creative variation A]\n│   │   ├── Ad 2: [Creative variation B]\n│   │   └── Ad 3: [Creative variation C]\n│   └── Ad Set 2: [Targeting variation]\n└── Campaign 2...\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```\n[Platform]_[Objective]_[Audience]_[Offer]_[Date]\n\nExamples:\nMETA_Conv_Lookalike-Customers_FreeTrial_2024Q1\nGOOG_Search_Brand_Demo_Ongoing\nLI_LeadGen_CMOs-SaaS_Whitepaper_Mar24\n```\n\n### Budget Allocation\n\n**Testing phase (first 2-4 weeks):**\n- 70% to proven/safe campaigns\n- 30% to testing new audiences/creative\n\n**Scaling phase:**\n- Consolidate budget into winning combinations\n- Increase budgets 20-30% at a time\n- Wait 3-5 days between increases for algorithm learning\n\n---\n\n## Ad Copy Frameworks\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS):**\n> [Problem] → [Agitate the pain] → [Introduce solution] → [CTA]\n\n**Before-After-Bridge (BAB):**\n> [Current painful state] → [Desired future state] → [Your product as bridge]\n\n**Social Proof Lead:**\n> [Impressive stat or testimonial] → [What you do] → [CTA]\n\n**For detailed templates and headline formulas**: See [references/ad-copy-templates.md](references/ad-copy-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Audience Targeting Overview\n\n### Platform Strengths\n\n| Platform | Key Targeting | Best Signals |\n|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| Google | Keywords, search intent | What they''re searching |\n| Meta | Interests, behaviors, lookalikes | Engagement patterns |\n| LinkedIn | Job titles, companies, industries | Professional identity |\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Lookalikes**: Base on best customers (by LTV), not all customers\n- **Retargeting**: Segment by funnel stage (visitors vs. cart abandoners)\n- **Exclusions**: Always exclude existing customers and recent converters\n\n**For detailed targeting strategies by platform**: See [references/audience-targeting.md](references/audience-targeting.md)\n\n---\n\n## Creative Best Practices\n\n### Image Ads\n- Clear product screenshots showing UI\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Stats and numbers as focal point\n- Human faces (real, not stock)\n- Bold, readable text overlay (keep under 20%)\n\n### Video Ads Structure (15-30 sec)\n1. Hook (0-3 sec): Pattern interrupt, question, or bold statement\n2. Problem (3-8 sec): Relatable pain point\n3. Solution (8-20 sec): Show product/benefit\n4. CTA (20-30 sec): Clear next step\n\n**Production tips:**\n- Captions always (85% watch without sound)\n- Vertical for Stories/Reels, square for feed\n- Native feel outperforms polished\n- First 3 seconds determine if they watch\n\n### Creative Testing Hierarchy\n1. Concept/angle (biggest impact)\n2. Hook/headline\n3. Visual style\n4. Body copy\n5. CTA\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Optimization\n\n### Key Metrics by Objective\n\n| Objective | Primary Metrics |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Awareness | CPM, Reach, Video view rate |\n| Consideration | CTR, CPC, Time on site |\n| Conversion | CPA, ROAS, Conversion rate |\n\n### Optimization Levers\n\n**If CPA is too high:**\n1. Check landing page (is the problem post-click?)\n2. Tighten audience targeting\n3. Test new creative angles\n4. Improve ad relevance/quality score\n5. Adjust bid strategy\n\n**If CTR is low:**\n- Creative isn''t resonating → test new hooks/angles\n- Audience mismatch → refine targeting\n- Ad fatigue → refresh creative\n\n**If CPM is high:**\n- Audience too narrow → expand targeting\n- High competition → try different placements\n- Low relevance score → improve creative fit\n\n### Bid Strategy Progression\n1. Start with manual or cost caps\n2. Gather conversion data (50+ conversions)\n3. Switch to automated with targets based on historical data\n4. Monitor and adjust targets based on results\n\n---\n\n## Retargeting Strategies\n\n### Funnel-Based Approach\n\n| Funnel Stage | Audience | Message | Goal |\n|--------------|----------|---------|------|\n| Top | Blog readers, video viewers | Educational, social proof | Move to consideration |\n| Middle | Pricing/feature page visitors | Case studies, demos | Move to decision |\n| Bottom | Cart abandoners, trial users | Urgency, objection handling | Convert |\n\n### Retargeting Windows\n\n| Stage | Window | Frequency Cap |\n|-------|--------|---------------|\n| Hot (cart/trial) | 1-7 days | Higher OK |\n| Warm (key pages) | 7-30 days | 3-5x/week |\n| Cold (any visit) | 30-90 days | 1-2x/week |\n\n### Exclusions to Set Up\n- Existing customers (unless upsell)\n- Recent converters (7-14 day window)\n- Bounced visitors (<10 sec)\n- Irrelevant pages (careers, support)\n\n---\n\n## Reporting & Analysis\n\n### Weekly Review\n- Spend vs. budget pacing\n- CPA/ROAS vs. targets\n- Top and bottom performing ads\n- Audience performance breakdown\n- Frequency check (fatigue risk)\n- Landing page conversion rate\n\n### Attribution Considerations\n- Platform attribution is inflated\n- Use UTM parameters consistently\n- Compare platform data to GA4\n- Look at blended CAC, not just platform CPA\n\n---\n\n## Platform Setup\n\nBefore launching campaigns, ensure proper tracking and account setup.\n\n**For complete setup checklists by platform**: See [references/platform-setup-checklists.md](references/platform-setup-checklists.md)\n\n### Universal Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Conversion tracking tested with real conversion\n- [ ] Landing page loads fast (<3 sec)\n- [ ] Landing page mobile-friendly\n- [ ] UTM parameters working\n- [ ] Budget set correctly\n- [ ] Targeting matches intended audience\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Strategy\n- Launching without conversion tracking\n- Too many campaigns (fragmenting budget)\n- Not giving algorithms enough learning time\n- Optimizing for wrong metric\n\n### Targeting\n- Audiences too narrow or too broad\n- Not excluding existing customers\n- Overlapping audiences competing\n\n### Creative\n- Only one ad per ad set\n- Not refreshing creative (fatigue)\n- Mismatch between ad and landing page\n\n### Budget\n- Spreading too thin across campaigns\n- Making big budget changes (disrupts learning)\n- Stopping campaigns during learning phase\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What platform(s) are you currently running or want to start with?\n2. What''s your monthly ad budget?\n3. What does a successful conversion look like (and what''s it worth)?\n4. Do you have existing creative assets or need to create them?\n5. What landing page will ads point to?\n6. Do you have pixel/conversion tracking set up?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key advertising platforms:\n\n| Platform | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|----------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Google Ads** | Search intent, high-intent traffic | ✓ | [google-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/google-ads.md) |\n| **Meta Ads** | Demand gen, visual products, B2C | - | [meta-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/meta-ads.md) |\n| **LinkedIn Ads** | B2B, job title targeting | - | [linkedin-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/linkedin-ads.md) |\n| **TikTok Ads** | Younger demographics, video | - | [tiktok-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/tiktok-ads.md) |\n\nFor tracking, see also: [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md), [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For landing page copy that converts ad traffic\n- **analytics-tracking**: For proper conversion tracking setup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For landing page testing to improve ROAS\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing post-click conversion rates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:05.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Marketing Agents specializing in performance marketing and requiring advanced campaign optimization capabilities with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, and Terraform.","zh":"适合专注于性能营销的营销代理商，需要使用Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter和Terraform进行高级_campaign优化的能力。","ja":"パフォーマンスマーケティングに特化したマーケティングエージェントで、Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraformを使用した高度なキャンペーン最適化機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"성능 마케팅에 전문적인 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합하며, Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter 및 Terraform를 사용하여 고급 캠페인 최적화를 요구하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de marketing que se especializan en marketing de rendimiento y requieren capacidades avanzadas de optimización de campañas con Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter y Terraform.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans le marketing de performance et nécessitant des capacités avancées d''optimisation de campagnes avec Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter et Terraform.","de":"Ideal für Marketing-Agenten, die sich auf Performance-Marketing spezialisieren und erweiterte Kampagnenoptimierungsfähigkeiten mit Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter und Terraform benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing especializados em marketing de desempenho e que exigem capacidades avançadas de otimização de campanha com Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter e Terraform.","ru":"Идеально для Маркетинговых Агентов, специализирующихся на маркетинге эффективности и требующих расширенных возможностей оптимизации кампаний с помощью Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter и Terraform.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الترويجية المتخصصة في تسويق الأداء والمتطلبات المتقدمة لتحسين الحملات باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns using production-ready full-stack monorepo templates, leveraging Next.js for frontend, FastAPI for backend, Flutter for mobile, and Terraform for infrastructure management, to drive efficient customer acquisition.","zh":"赋予代理商使用生产就绪的全栈monorepo模板，利用Next.js进行前端、FastAPI进行后端、Flutter进行移动端、Terraform进行基础设施管理，来驱动高效的客户获取。","ja":"エージェントがプロダクションレディのフルスタックmonorepoテンプレートを使用して、Next.jsによるフロントエンド、FastAPIによるバックエンド、Flutterによるモバイル、Terraformによるインフラストラクチャ管理を利用して、効率的な顧客獲得を推進できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 생산 준비가 된 전체 스택 monorepo 템플릿을 사용하여 Next.js를 통한 프론트 엔드, FastAPI를 통한 백 엔드, Flutter를 통한 모바일, Terraform를 통한 인프라 관리를 사용하여 효율적인 고객 확보를 구동할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, optimizar y escalar campañas publicitarias pagas utilizando plantillas de monorepo de pila completa listas para producción, aprovechando Next.js para frontend, FastAPI para backend, Flutter para móviles y Terraform para la administración de infraestructura, para impulsar la adquisición eficiente de clientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''optimiser et de développer des campagnes publicitaires payantes en utilisant des modèles de monorepo full-stack prêts pour la production, en exploitant Next.js pour le frontend, FastAPI pour le backend, Flutter pour les applications mobiles et Terraform pour la gestion des infrastructures, afin de stimuler l''acquisition efficace de clients.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bezahlte Werbekampagnen zu erstellen, zu optimieren und zu skalieren, indem sie produktionsbereite Full-Stack-Monorepo-Vorlagen verwenden, die Next.js für Frontend, FastAPI für Backend, Flutter für Mobile und Terraform für Infrastrukturmanagement nutzen, um eine effiziente Kundenakquise zu fördern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem, otimizem e dimensionem campanhas publicitárias pagas usando modelos de monorepo de pilha completa prontos para produção, aproveitando Next.js para frontend, FastAPI para backend, Flutter para móvel e Terraform para gerenciamento de infraestrutura, para impulsionar a aquisição eficiente de clientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, оптимизировать и масштабировать платные рекламные кампании, используя шаблоны монорепо полной стека, готовые к производству, которые используют Next.js для frontend, FastAPI для backend, Flutter для мобильных устройств и Terraform для управления инфраструктурой, чтобы обеспечить эффективный привлечение клиентов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وحسابة وتوسيع الحملات الإعلانية المدفوعة باستخدام قوالب مونوريبو كاملة للطوافات جاهزة للإنتاج، واستخدام Next.js لامام الواجهة و FastAPI للخلفية و Flutter للجوال و Terraform لإدارة البنية التحتية، لدفع كفاءة إكتساب العملاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating paid advertising campaign creation across multiple platforms","Optimizing campaign performance using data-driven insights from Next.js and FastAPI","Scaling advertising efforts with infrastructure-as-code using Terraform"],"zh":["跨多个平台自动创建付费广告活动","使用来自Next.js和FastAPI的数据驱动的洞察力来优化活动性能","使用Terraform的基础设施即代码来扩展广告努力"],"ja":["複数のプラットフォームを横断して有料広告キャンペーンを作成する自動化","Next.jsとFastAPIからのデータドリブンの洞察を使用してキャンペーンのパフォーマンスを最適化する","Terraformのインフラストラクチャ即コードを使用して広告努力をスケールする"],"ko":["여러 플랫폼에서 유료 광고 캠페인을 자동으로 생성하는 것","Next.js와 FastAPI에서 데이터를驱动하여 캠페인 성능을 최적화하는 것","Terraform의 인프라스트럭처 即 코드를 사용하여 광고 노력을 확장하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de campañas publicitarias pagas en varias plataformas","Optimizar el rendimiento de la campaña utilizando información basada en datos de Next.js y FastAPI","Escalizar los esfuerzos publicitarios con infraestructura como código utilizando Terraform"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de campagnes publicitaires payantes sur plusieurs plateformes","Optimiser les performances de la campagne en utilisant des informations basées sur les données de Next.js et FastAPI","Développer les efforts publicitaires avec l''infrastructure en tant que code en utilisant Terraform"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von bezahlten Werbekampagnen auf mehreren Plattformen","Optimieren der Kampagnenleistung mithilfe datengetriebener Erkenntnisse von Next.js und FastAPI","Skalieren der Werbebemühungen mit Infrastruktur als Code unter Verwendung von Terraform"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de campanhas publicitárias pagas em várias plataformas","Otimizar o desempenho da campanha usando insights baseados em dados do Next.js e FastAPI","Dimensionar esforços publicitários com infraestrutura como código usando Terraform"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание платных рекламных кампаний на нескольких платформах","Оптимизировать производительность кампании, используя данные, основанные на данных из Next.js и FastAPI","Масштабировать рекламные усилия с помощью инфраструктуры как кода с использованием Terraform"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء حملات إعلانية مدفوعة عبر منصات متعددة","تحسين أداء الحملة باستخدام معلومات استخباراتية مدفوعة بالبيانات من Next.js و FastAPI","توسيع الجهود الإعلانية باستخدام البنية التحتية ككود باستخدام Terraform"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ad platform accounts","Dependent on specific tech stack: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"zh":["需要访问广告平台账户","依赖于特定的技术栈：Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform"],"ja":["広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスが必要","特定のテクノロジースタック：Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraformに依存する"],"ko":["광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스가 필요함","특정 기술 스택: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a cuentas de plataformas de anuncios","Dependiente de una pila tecnológica específica: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité","Dépend d''une pile technologique spécifique : Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten","Abhängig von einer bestimmten Technologie-Stack: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"pt":["Exige acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios","Dependente de pilha de tecnologia específica: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"ru":["Требует доступа к учетным записям рекламных платформ","Зависит от конкретного стека технологий: Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلان","يعتمد على حزمة تقنية محددة: Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"29d1f50e17b59b04556191bf82a77e51f72ce34d3034525f017d4835109ed35a","qualityScore":36}');
