P","curl","recettes de configuration","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Agents d''IA pour les applications web"],"de":["config-schema-setup","Konfiguration von Typsicheren Umgebungen","Full-Stack-Webanwendungen","MCP-Server","curl","Konfigurationsrezepte","AI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für Webanwendungen"],"pt":["config-schema-setup","configuração de esquema de configuração","aplicativos web de IA","fullstackrecipes MCP server","Type-Safe Environment Configuration","curl para fetch de receitas"],"ru":["config-schema-setup","настройка конфигурации схемы","веб-приложения ИИ","fullstackrecipes MCP server для ИИ Агентов","Type-Safe Environment Configuration","curl для получения рецептов"],"ar":["مخطط التهيئة","إعداد مخطط التهيئة","تطبيقات الويب الإعلامية الاصطناعية","مورد الخادم MCP من fullstackrecipes","تهيئة بيئة آمنة","استخدام curl ل FETCH وصفات"]}},"owner":"andrelandgraf","repo":"fullstackrecipes","repoPath":"andrelandgraf/fullstackrecipes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.338Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"config-schema-setup","description":"Type-safe environment variable validation using Zod with a Drizzle-like schema API. Supports server/public fields, feature flags, either-or constraints, and client-side protection.","bodyPreview":"# Type-Safe Environment Configuration\n\nTo set up Type-Safe Environment Configuration, refer to the fullstackrecipes MCP server resource:\n\n**Resource URI:** `recipe://fullstackrecipes.com/config-schema-setup`\n\nIf the MCP server is not configured, fetch the recipe directly:\n\n```bash\ncurl -H \"Accept: text/plain\" https://fullstackrecipes.com/api/recipes/config-schema-setup\n```","body":"# Type-Safe Environment Configuration\n\nTo set up Type-Safe Environment Configuration, refer to the fullstackrecipes MCP server resource:\n\n**Resource URI:** `recipe://fullstackrecipes.com/config-schema-setup`\n\nIf the MCP server is not configured, fetch the recipe directly:\n\n```bash\nc