 connaissances qui met à jour de manière intelligente les rôles et les documents dans Claude Code","de":"Das Lernen ist eine Wissensmanagement-Funktion, die Rollen und Dokumente in Claude Code intelligent aktualisiert","pt":"O que é Learn? É um agente de aprendizado de máquina que atualiza papéis e documentos com base em resumos de sessão","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Learn? Это агент машинного обучения, который обновляет роли и документы на основе сводок сессий","ar":"ما هو وكيل التعلم الاصطناعي Learn؟ هو وكيل تعلم الاصطناعي يقوم بتحديث الأدوار والوثائق بناءً على ملخصات الجلسات"},"features":{"en":["Intelligent curation of role structures","Appends timestamped session summaries to Recent Context","Curates currently relevant information in Right Now section","Utilizes Context Lake pattern for efficient knowledge management","Integrates with MCP for seamless updates","Activates on user commands like ''learn'' and ''update roles''"],"zh":["智能更新角色和文档","文件系统知识管理","MCP 통합","Context Lake 패턴","会话总结自动更新"],"ja":["役割と文書の智能更新","ファイルシステムの知識管理","MCP統合","Context Lakeパターン","セッションサマリーの自動更新"],"ko":["역할과 문서의 지능형 업데이트","파일 시스템 지식 관리","MCP 통합","Context Lake 패턴","세션 요약 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Actualización inteligente de roles y documentos","Integración con el patrón de lago de contexto y MCP","Gestión de conocimientos basada en el sistema de archivos","Curación de contenido relevante","Historial de contexto reciente"],"fr":["Mise à jour intelligente des rôles et des documents","Intégration avec le modèle de lac de contexte et MCP","Gestion des connaissances basée sur le système de fichiers","Curration de contenu pertinent","Historique de contexte récent"],"de":["Intelligente Aktualisierung von Rollen und Dokumenten","Integration mit dem Kontext-See-Muster und MCP","Dateisystembasiertes Wissensmanagement","Kuration von relevantem Inhalt","Historie des aktuellen Kontexts"],"pt":["Atualização inteligente de papéis e documentos","Integração com o padrão Context Lake","Utilização de MCP para atualizar informações","Curação de conteúdo com base em resumos de sessão","Armazenamento de informações em um lake de contexto"],"ru":["Интеллектуальное обновление ролей и документов","Интеграция с шаблоном Context Lake","Использование MCP для обновления информации","Кураторство контента на основе сводок сессий","Хранение информации в lake контекста"],"ar":["تحديث ذكي للأدوار والوثائق","التكامل مع نمط Context Lake","استخدام MCP لتحديث المعلومات","تنقية المحتوى بناءً على ملخصات الجلسات","تخزين المعلومات في بحيرة السياق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use learn","what is learn","learn alternative","learn vs knowledge management systems","learn install guide","learn setup for AI agents","intelligent role curation","Context Lake pattern","MCP integration"],"zh":["Learn","Claude Code","文件系统知识管理","AIエージェント","MCP","Context Lake","智能更新","角色更新"],"ja":["Learn","AIエージェント","役割更新","MCP","Context Lake","ファイルシステムの知識管理","智能更新","セッションサマリー"],"ko":["Learn","Claude Code","파일 시스템 지식 관리","AI 에이전트","MCP","Context Lake","지능형 업데이트","역할 업데이트"],"es":["aprendizaje automático Claude Code","gestión de conocimientos","sistema de archivos","patrón de lago de contexto","MCP","curación de contenido","roles y documentos","integración de AI","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["apprentissage automatique Claude Code","gestion des connaissances","système de fichiers","modèle de lac de contexte","MCP","curration de contenu","rôles et documents","intégration d''IA","outils de développement"],"de":["maschinelles Lernen Claude Code","Wissensmanagement","Dateisystem","Kontext-See-Muster","MCP","Kuration von Inhalt","Rollen und Dokumente","Integration von KI","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["aprendizado de máquina","agentes de aprendizado","Context Lake","MCP","curação de conteúdo","armazenamento de informações","inteligência artificial","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["машинное обучение","агенты машинного обучения","Context Lake","MCP","кураторство контента","хранение информации","искусственный интеллект","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تعلم الاصطناعي","وكلاء التعلم الاصطناعي","Context Lake","MCP","تنقية المحتوى","تخزين المعلومات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"joshuacook","repo":"motoko","repoPath":"joshuacook/motoko","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"learn","description":"Process inbox summaries and update system knowledge. Curates role Right Now sections, appends Recent Context, updates central docs. Intelligent curation, not just appending.","bodyPreview":"# Learn (System Learning)\n\nIntelligently update roles and docs based on session summaries.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User says: \"learn\", \"update roles\"\n- After compressing sessions\n- When inbox has session summaries\n\n## Approach\n\n**OLD:** Append bullets to logs\n**NEW:** Intelligent curation\n\n**Role structure:**\n- What This Role Does (rarely changes)\n- **Right Now** ← CURATE (what''s currently relevant)\n- **Recent Context** ← APPEND (timestamped, last 30 days)\n- How This Role Operates (rarely change","body":"# Learn (System Learning)\n\nIntelligently update roles and docs based on session summaries.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- User says: \"learn\", \"update roles\"\n- After compressing sessions\n- When inbox has session summaries\n\n## Approach\n\n**OLD:** Append bullets to logs\n**NEW:** Intelligent curation\n\n**Role structure:**\n- What This Role Does (rarely changes)\n- **Right Now** ← CURATE (what''s currently relevant)\n- **Recent Context** ← APPEND (timestamped, last 30 days)\n- How This Role Operates (rarely changes)\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Read Inbox\n\n```bash\nls inbox/session-summaries/\ncat inbox/session-summaries/*.md\n```\n\n### 2. Analyze Changes\n\n**Extract from summaries:**\n- Decisions made\n- Tools/workflows built\n- Role activity\n- Context changes\n\n**Categorize:**\n- **Right Now:** What''s newly relevant for ongoing work\n- **Recent Context:** Timestamped decisions (auto-prune > 30 days)\n\n### 3. Create Branch\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b learning-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n```\n\n### 4. Update Roles\n\n**For each affected role:**\n\n#### A. Read Current Role\n```bash\ncat roles/[role-file].md\n```\n\n#### B. Curate \"Right Now\"\n\nThis is CURATION, not appending:\n1. Read existing \"Right Now\"\n2. Add newly relevant context\n3. Remove stale/no-longer-relevant items\n4. Keep tight (5-10 bullets max)\n\n#### C. Append \"Recent Context\"\n\nAdd timestamped entry at top:\n```markdown\n## Recent Context (Last 30 Days)\n\n**YYYY-MM-DD:** [Summary]\n- Key point 1\n- Key point 2\n\n[...existing entries...]\n```\n\nAuto-prune if > 10 entries.\n\n#### D. Update \"Last Updated\"\n\n### 5. Commit and PR\n\n```bash\ngit add roles/*.md\ngit commit -m \"System learning: [summary]\"\ngit push -u origin learning-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\ngh pr create --title \"System Learning $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\" --body \"...\"\ngit checkout main\n```\n\n### 6. Report\n\n```\nSystem learning complete.\n\nProcessed: [N] session summaries\nRoles updated: [list]\nBranch: learning-YYYY-MM-DD\nPR: #[number]\n\nNext: Review and merge PR.\n```\n\n## Curation Guidelines\n\n**\"Right Now\" = what''s relevant:**\n- Shapes how role operates TODAY\n- Would need to know this to do role''s job\n- NOT just recent - could be weeks old but still relevant\n\n**\"Recent Context\" = what happened:**\n- Timestamped decisions\n- Links to details if needed\n- Auto-prune oldest when > 10 entries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:44.343Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Management Agents requiring intelligent updates of roles and documents based on session summaries.","zh":"适用于需要智能更新角色和文档的基于会话总结的知识管理代理。","ja":"セッションの要約に基づいて役割と文書をインテリジェントに更新する必要があるナレッジ管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"세션 요약에 따라 역할과 문서를 지능적으로 업데이트해야 하는 지식 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Conocimiento que requieren actualizaciones inteligentes de roles y documentos basadas en resúmenes de sesiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion des connaissances nécessitant des mises à jour intelligentes de rôles et de documents basées sur des résumés de sessions.","de":"Ideal für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die intelligente Updates von Rollen und Dokumenten auf Basis von Sitzungszusammenfassungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que exigem atualizações inteligentes de funções e documentos com base em resumos de sessão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, требующих интеллектуальных обновлений ролей и документов на основе сводок сессий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يتطلبون تحديثات ذكية للأدوار والوثائق بناءً على ملخصات الجلسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently curate knowledge using the Context Lake pattern with MCP integration, enabling efficient updates of roles and documents through intelligent session summary analysis and appending relevant information to role structures.","zh":"通过使用Context Lake模式和MCP集成，赋予代理智能地策划知识的能力，使得可以通过智能会话总结分析和将相关信息追加到角色结构中，高效地更新角色和文档。","ja":"Context LakeパターンとMCPの統合を使用することで、エージェントにナレッジをインテリジェントにキュレーションする能力を与え、セッションの要約を分析し、役割構造に関連情報を追加することで、役割と文書を効率的に更新できるようになります。","ko":"Context Lake 패턴과 MCP 통합을 사용하여 에이전트가 지식을 지능적으로 큐레이션할 수 있도록 해주며, 지능적인 세션 요약 분석과 관련 정보를 역할 구조에 추가하여 역할과 문서를 효율적으로 업데이트할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a curar conocimiento de manera inteligente utilizando el patrón Context Lake con integración MCP, lo que permite actualizaciones eficientes de roles y documentos a través del análisis inteligente de resúmenes de sesiones y la adición de información relevante a estructuras de roles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de curer des connaissances de manière intelligente en utilisant le modèle Context Lake avec une intégration MCP, ce qui permet des mises à jour efficaces de rôles et de documents grâce à l''analyse intelligente de résumés de sessions et à l''ajout d''informations pertinentes aux structures de rôles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Wissen intelligent zu kuratieren, indem sie das Context-Lake-Muster mit MCP-Integration verwenden, was effiziente Updates von Rollen und Dokumenten durch intelligente Analyse von Sitzungszusammenfassungen und Hinzufügen von relevanten Informationen zu Rollenstrukturen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a curar conhecimento de forma inteligente usando o padrão Context Lake com integração MCP, permitindo atualizações eficientes de funções e documentos por meio da análise inteligente do resumo da sessão e anexando informações relevantes às estruturas de funções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально курировать знания с помощью шаблона Context Lake с интеграцией MCP, ermögляя эффективные обновления ролей и документов посредством интеллектуального анализа сводок сессий и добавления соответствующей информации к структурам ролей.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنقيح المعرفة بذكاء باستخدام نمط Context Lake مع التكامل MCP، وتمكين تحديثات فعالة للأدوار والوثائق من خلال تحليل ملخص الجلسة بذكاء وإضافة المعلومات ذات الصلة إلى هياكل الأدوار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating role updates based on session summaries","Intelligently curating recent context for roles","Appending timestamped session summaries to role documents"],"zh":["基于会话总结自动更新角色","为角色智能策划最近的上下文","将时间戳的会话总结追加到角色文档中"],"ja":["セッションの要約に基づいて役割を自動更新する","役割の最近のコンテキストをインテリジェントにキュレーションする","役割の文書にタイムスタンプ付きのセッションの要約を追加する"],"ko":["세션 요약에 따라 역할을 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","역할의 최근 컨텍스트를 지능적으로 큐레이션하는 것","역할 문서에 타임스탬프가 있는 세션 요약을 추가하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de roles basadas en resúmenes de sesiones","Curar inteligentemente el contexto reciente para roles","Agregar resúmenes de sesiones con marca de tiempo a documentos de roles"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de rôles basées sur des résumés de sessions","Curer de manière intelligente le contexte récent pour les rôles","Ajouter des résumés de sessions avec horodatage aux documents de rôles"],"de":["Automatisierung von Rollen-Updates basierend auf Sitzungszusammenfassungen","Intelligentes Kuratieren des aktuellen Kontexts für Rollen","Hinzufügen von Sitzungszusammenfassungen mit Zeitstempel zu Rollendokumenten"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de funções com base em resumos de sessão","Curar inteligentemente o contexto recente para funções","Anexar resumos de sessão com carimbo de data/hora aos documentos de funções"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления ролей на основе сводок сессий","Интеллектуально курировать最近ний контекст для ролей","Добавлять сводки сессий с меткой времени к документам ролей"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات الأدوار بناءً على ملخصات الجلسة","تنقيح السياق الأخير للأدوار بذكاء","إضافة ملخصات الجلسة المضيفة للتاريخ والوقت إلى وثائق الأدوار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires session summaries in inbox","Limited to updating roles and documents based on 30-day recent context"],"zh":["需要收件箱中的会话总结","仅限于基于30天最近的上下文更新角色和文档"],"ja":["受信トレイにセッションの要約が必要","役割と文書を更新するのは30日間の最近のコンテキストに限定される"],"ko":["받은 편지함에 있는 세션 요약이 필요함","30일간 최근 컨텍스트를 기반으로 역할과 문서를 업데이트하는 것만 가능"],"es":["Requiere resúmenes de sesiones en la bandeja de entrada","Limitado a la actualización de roles y documentos basada en el contexto reciente de 30 días"],"fr":["Nécessite des résumés de sessions dans la boîte de réception","Limité à la mise à jour de rôles et de documents basée sur le contexte récent de 30 jours"],"de":["Benötigt Sitzungszusammenfassungen im Posteingang","Begrenzt auf Updates von Rollen und Dokumenten basierend auf dem aktuellen Kontext der letzten 30 Tage"],"pt":["Exige resumos de sessão na caixa de entrada","Limitado a atualizar funções e documentos com base no contexto recente de 30 dias"],"ru":["Требует сводок сессий в входящих","Ограничен обновлением ролей и документов на основе最近него контекста за 30 дней"],"ar":["يتطلب ملخصات الجلسة في البريد الوارد","محدود بتحديث الأدوار والوثائق بناءً على السياق الأخير لمدة 30 يومًا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e06e8d004a5ac2171962564a193cf269061812290337589debf241d06926dc06","qualityScore":36}');
