eport는 코드베이스의 AI 개발 준비 상황을 평가하는 도구입니다","es":"El informe de preparación para agentes de IA es una herramienta que evalúa la preparación de un repositorio para el desarrollo autónomo de IA","fr":"Le rapport de préparation pour les agents d''IA est un outil qui évalue la préparation d''un référentiel pour le développement autonome d''IA","de":"Der Bereitschaftsbericht für KI-Agenten ist ein Werkzeug, das die Bereitschaft eines Repositorys für die autonome KI-Entwicklung bewertet","pt":"O que é readiness-report? É uma ferramenta de avaliação da prontidão do repositório para desenvolvimento autônomo de IA","ru":"Что такое readiness-report? Это инструмент для оценки готовности репозитория для автономного развития ИИ","ar":"ما هو تقرير الجاهزية؟ هو أداة لتقييم جاهزية المستودع لتنمية الوكلاء الذكيين"},"features":{"en":["Evaluates repositories across nine technical pillars","Analyzes five maturity levels for AI-assisted development","Identifies gaps in feedback loops, documentation, and tooling","Prioritizes fixes to improve codebase readiness","Runs using the `/readiness-report` command"],"zh":["评估代码库的 AI 开发准备情况","分析九个技术支柱和五个成熟度级别","找出改进的机会","优先级修复","支持 CLI 命令 `/readiness-report`"],"ja":["コードベースの AI 開発の準備状況を評価","9 つの技術的柱と 5 つの成熟度レベルを分析","改善の機会を特定","優先順位の付いた修正","CLI コマンド `/readiness-report` をサポート"],"ko":["코드베이스의 AI 개발 준비 상황을 평가","9개의 기술적 기둥과 5개의 성숙도 수준을 분석","개선할 기회를 찾아","우선순위가 있는 수정","CLI 명령어 `/readiness-report` 지원"],"es":["Análisis de nueve pilares técnicos","Evaluación de cinco niveles de madurez","Identificación de brechas y priorización de soluciones","Soporte para desarrollo autónomo de IA","Integración con la arquitectura BMAD-CORE v6"],"fr":["Analyse de neuf piliers techniques","Évaluation de cinq niveaux de maturité","Identification des lacunes et priorisation des solutions","Prise en charge du développement autonome d''IA","Intégration avec l''architecture BMAD-CORE v6"],"de":["Analyse von neun technischen Säulen","Bewertung von fünf Reifegraden","Identifizierung von Lücken und Priorisierung von Lösungen","Unterstützung für autonome KI-Entwicklung","Integration mit der Architektur BMAD-CORE v6"],"pt":["Avaliação da prontidão do repositório em 9 pilares técnicos","Identificação de lacunas e priorização de soluções","Análise da maturidade do repositório em 5 níveis","Suporte à desenvolvimento autônomo de IA","Integração com a arquitetura BMAD-CORE v6"],"ru":["Оценка готовности репозитория по 9 техническим столпам","Выявление пробелов и определение приоритетов для их устранения","Анализ зрелости репозитория на 5 уровнях","Поддержка автономного развития ИИ","Интеграция с архитектурой BMAD-CORE v6"],"ar":["تقييم جاهزية المستودع على 9 ركائز تقنية","تحديد الفجوات وترتيب الأولويات لمعالجتها","تحليل نضج المستودع على 5 مستويات","دعم تطور الوكلاء الذكيين الذاتي","التكامل مع بنية BMAD-CORE v6"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use readiness-report","readiness-report alternative","readiness-report setup guide","what is readiness-report","readiness-report vs competitor","readiness-report install","AI agent development","autonomous AI development","codebase readiness"],"zh":["AIエージェント","Readiness Report","AI 开发","代码库评估","技术支柱","成熟度级别","CLI 命令","AI 工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Readiness Report","AI 開発","コードベース評価","技術的柱","成熟度レベル","CLI コマンド","AI ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Readiness Report","AI 개발","코드베이스 평가","기술적 기둥","성숙도 수준","CLI 명령어","AI 도구"],"es":["informe de preparación para agentes de IA","desarrollo autónomo de IA","análisis de pilares técnicos","evaluación de madurez","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","agentes de IA para finanzas","BMAD-CORE v6"],"fr":["rapport de préparation pour les agents d''IA","développement autonome d''IA","analyse de piliers techniques","évaluation de maturité","outils d''IA pour développeurs","agents d''IA pour la finance","BMAD-CORE v6"],"de":["Bereitschaftsbericht für KI-Agenten","autonome KI-Entwicklung","Analyse von technischen Säulen","Bewertung von Reifegraden","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agenten für Finanzen","BMAD-CORE v6"],"pt":["readiness-report","desenvolvimento autônomo de IA","ferramentas de IA","avaliação da prontidão","BMAD-CORE v6","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["readiness-report","автономное развитие ИИ","ИИ Агенты","оценка готовности","BMAD-CORE v6","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["تقرير الجاهزية","تطور الوكلاء الذكيين الذاتي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقييم الجاهزية","BMAD-CORE v6","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"AojdevStudio","repo":"Finance-Guru","repoPath":"AojdevStudio/Finance-Guru","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.369Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readiness-report","description":"Evaluate how well a codebase supports autonomous AI development. Analyzes repositories across nine technical pillars (Style & Validation, Build System, Testing, Documentation, Dev Environment, Debugging & Observability, Security, Task Discovery, Product & Analytics) and five maturity levels. Use when users request `/readiness-report` or want to assess agent readiness, codebase maturity, or identify gaps preventing effective AI-assisted development.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Readiness Report\n\nEvaluate how well a repository supports autonomous AI development by analyzing it across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels.\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent Readiness measures how prepared a codebase is for AI-assisted development. Poor feedback loops, missing documentation, or lack of tooling cause agents to waste cycles on preventable errors. This skill identifies those gaps and prioritizes fixes.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe user will run `/readiness-report` to evaluate the","body":"# Agent Readiness Report\n\nEvaluate how well a repository supports autonomous AI development by analyzing it across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels.\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent Readiness measures how prepared a codebase is for AI-assisted development. Poor feedback loops, missing documentation, or lack of tooling cause agents to waste cycles on preventable errors. This skill identifies those gaps and prioritizes fixes.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe user will run `/readiness-report` to evaluate the current repository. The agent will then:\n1. Clone the repo, scan repository structure, CI configs, and tooling\n2. Evaluate 81 criteria across 9 technical pillars\n3. Determine maturity level (L1-L5) based on 80% threshold per level\n4. Provide prioritized recommendations\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Run Repository Analysis\n\nExecute the analysis script to gather signals from the repository:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/analyze_repo.py --repo-path .\n```\n\nThis script checks for:\n- Configuration files (.eslintrc, pyproject.toml, etc.)\n- CI/CD workflows (.github/workflows/, .gitlab-ci.yml)\n- Documentation (README, AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- Test infrastructure (test directories, coverage configs)\n- Security configurations (CODEOWNERS, .gitignore, secrets management)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Report\n\nAfter analysis, generate the formatted report:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_report.py --analysis-file /tmp/readiness_analysis.json\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Results\n\nThe report includes:\n1. **Overall Score**: Pass rate percentage and maturity level achieved\n2. **Level Progress**: Bar showing L1-L5 completion percentages\n3. **Strengths**: Top-performing pillars with passing criteria\n4. **Opportunities**: Prioritized list of improvements to implement\n5. **Detailed Criteria**: Full breakdown by pillar showing each criterion status\n\n## Nine Technical Pillars\n\nEach pillar addresses specific failure modes in AI-assisted development:\n\n| Pillar | Purpose | Key Signals |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| **Style & Validation** | Catch bugs instantly | Linters, formatters, type checkers |\n| **Build System** | Fast, reliable builds | Build docs, CI speed, automation |\n| **Testing** | Verify correctness | Unit/integration tests, coverage |\n| **Documentation** | Guide the agent | AGENTS.md, README, architecture docs |\n| **Dev Environment** | Reproducible setup | Devcontainer, env templates |\n| **Debugging & Observability** | Diagnose issues | Logging, tracing, metrics |\n| **Security** | Protect the codebase | CODEOWNERS, secrets management |\n| **Task Discovery** | Find work to do | Issue templates, PR templates |\n| **Product & Analytics** | Error-to-insight loop | Error tracking, product analytics |\n\nSee `references/criteria.md` for the complete list of 81 criteria per pillar.\n\n## Five Maturity Levels\n\n| Level | Name | Description | Agent Capability |\n|-------|------|-------------|------------------|\n| L1 | Initial | Basic version control | Manual assistance only |\n| L2 | Managed | Basic CI/CD and testing | Simple, well-defined tasks |\n| L3 | Standardized | Production-ready for agents | Routine maintenance |\n| L4 | Measured | Comprehensive automation | Complex features |\n| L5 | Optimized | Full autonomous capability | End-to-end development |\n\n**Level Progression**: To unlock a level, pass ≥80% of criteria at that level AND all previous levels.\n\nSee `references/maturity-levels.md` for detailed level requirements.\n\n## Interpreting Results\n\n### Pass vs Fail vs Skip\n\n- ✓ **Pass**: Criterion met (contributes to score)\n- ✗ **Fail**: Criterion not met (opportunity for improvement)\n- — **Skip**: Not applicable to this repository type (excluded from score)\n\n### Priority Order\n\nFix gaps in this order:\n1. **L1-L2 failures**: Foundation issues blocking basic agent operation\n2. **L3 failures**: Production readiness gaps\n3. **High-impact L4+ failures**: Optimization opportunities\n\n### Common Quick Wins\n\n1. **Add AGENTS.md**: Document commands, architecture, and workflows for AI agents\n2. **Configure pre-commit hooks**: Catch style issues before CI\n3. **Add PR/issue templates**: Structure task discovery\n4. **Document single-command setup**: Enable fast environment provisioning\n\n## Resources\n\n- `scripts/analyze_repo.py` - Repository analysis script\n- `scripts/generate_report.py` - Report generation and formatting\n- `references/criteria.md` - Complete criteria definitions by pillar\n- `references/maturity-levels.md` - Detailed level requirements\n\n## Automated Remediation\n\nAfter reviewing the report, common fixes can be automated:\n- Generate AGENTS.md from repository structure\n- Add missing issue/PR templates\n- Configure standard linters and formatters\n- Set up pre-commit hooks\n\nAsk to \"fix readiness gaps\" to begin automated remediation of failing criteria.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:24.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous AI Agents requiring repository evaluation and technical pillar assessment for AI-assisted development.","zh":"适合需要存储库评估和技术支柱评估的自主AI代理用于AI辅助开发。","ja":"リポジトリの評価と技術的柱の評価が必要な自律的なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"리포지토리 평가 및 기술적 기둥 평가가 필요한 자율적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Autónomos que requieren evaluación de repositorio y evaluación de pilares técnicos para desarrollo asistido por IA.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Autonomes nécessitant une évaluation de référentiel et une évaluation de piliers techniques pour le développement assisté par IA.","de":"Ideal für autonome KI-Agents, die eine Repository-Evaluierung und eine technische Pfeilerbewertung für die KI-gestützte Entwicklung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos de IA que exigem avaliação de repositório e avaliação de pilares técnicos para desenvolvimento assistido por IA.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов ИИ, требующих оценки репозитория и оценки технических столпов для разработки с помощью ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقل الذي يتطلب تقييم المستودع وتقييم الركائز الفنية لتطوير معزز بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze repositories across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels, identifying gaps and prioritizing fixes through comprehensive content analysis and feedback loop optimization, utilizing technical keywords like ''autonomous AI development'', ''repository support'', and ''maturity levels'' to ensure seamless AI integration.","zh":"赋予代理分析跨九个技术支柱和五个成熟度级别的存储库的能力，找出差距并优先修复，通过综合内容分析和反馈循环优化，利用诸如''自主AI开发''、''存储库支持''和''成熟度级别''的技术关键词，以确保无缝的AI集成。","ja":"エージェントが9つの技術的柱と5つの成熟度レベルを横断するリポジトリを分析し、ギャップを特定し、優先順位の付けに基づいて修復する機能を提供し、包括的なコンテンツ分析とフィードバックループの最適化を使用し、''自律的なAI開発''、''リポジトリサポート''、''成熟度レベル''などの技術キーワードを使用して、シームレスなAI統合を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 9개의 기술적 기둥과 5개의 성숙도 수준을横断하는 리포지토리를 분석하여 격차를 식별하고, 우선 순위를 정하여 수정하며, 포괄적인 내용 분석 및 피드백 루프 최적화를 사용하며, ''자율적 AI 개발'', ''리포지토리 지원'', ''성숙도 수준''과 같은 기술 키워드를 사용하여 무결점의 AI 통합을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar referencias en nueve pilares técnicos y cinco niveles de madurez, identificando brechas y priorizando soluciones a través de un análisis de contenido integral y la optimización de un bucle de retroalimentación, utilizando palabras clave técnicas como ''desarrollo de IA autónoma'', ''soporte de repositorio'' y ''niveles de madurez'' para garantizar una integración de IA sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser des référentiels à travers neuf piliers techniques et cinq niveaux de maturité, en identifiant les lacunes et en priorisant les corrections grâce à une analyse de contenu complète et à l''optimisation d''une boucle de rétroaction, en utilisant des mots-clés techniques comme ''développement d''IA autonome'', ''support de référentiel'' et ''niveaux de maturité'' pour assurer une intégration d''IA transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Repositorys über neun technische Pfeiler und fünf Reifegradstufen hinweg zu analysieren, Lücken zu identifizieren und Korrekturen basierend auf Reifegradstufen und Feedback-Schleifenanalyse zu priorisieren, indem es eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und eine Optimierung der Feedback-Schleife unter Verwendung technischer Schlüsselwörter wie ''autonome KI-Entwicklung'', ''Repository-Unterstützung'' und ''Reifegradstufen'' zur Gewährleistung einer nahtlosen KI-Integration nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar repositórios em nove pilares técnicos e cinco níveis de maturidade, identificando lacunas e priorizando soluções por meio de análise de conteúdo abrangente e otimização do loop de feedback, utilizando palavras-chave técnicas como ''desenvolvimento autônomo de IA'', ''suporte a repositório'' e ''níveis de maturidade'' para garantir integração de IA sem problemas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность анализировать репозитории по девяти техническим столпам и пяти уровням зрелости, выявляя пробелы и определяя приоритеты исправлений посредством всестороннего анализа содержания и оптимизации цикла обратной связи, используя технические ключевые слова, такие как ''автономное развитие ИИ'', ''поддержка репозитория'' и ''уровни зрелости'', для обеспечения бесперебойной интеграции ИИ.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل المستودعات عبر تسعة ركائز فنية وخمسة مستويات من النضج، وتحديد الفجوات وتحديد الأولويات للصلح من خلال تحليل محتوى شامل وتحسين حلقة التغذية الراجعة، باستخدام الكلمات الرئيسية الفنية مثل ''التطوير المستقل للذكاء الاصطناعي'' و ''دعم المستودع'' و ''مستويات النضج'' لضمان تكامل الذكاء الاصطناعي بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating repository support for autonomous AI development","Identifying gaps in technical pillars for AI-assisted development","Prioritizing fixes based on maturity levels and feedback loop analysis"],"zh":["评估存储库对自主AI开发的支持","找出AI辅助开发的技术支柱中的差距","根据成熟度级别和反馈循环分析优先修复"],"ja":["自律的なAI開発のためのリポジトリサポートの評価","AI支援開発のための技術的柱のギャップの特定","成熟度レベルとフィードバックループ分析に基づく優先順位の付けによる修復"],"ko":["자율적 AI 개발을 위한 리포지토리 지원 평가","AI 지원 개발을 위한 기술적 기둥의 격차 식별","성숙도 수준 및 피드백 루프 분석에 의한 우선 순위 설정을 통한 수정"],"es":["Evaluación del soporte de repositorio para el desarrollo de IA autónoma","Identificación de brechas en los pilares técnicos para el desarrollo asistido por IA","Priorización de soluciones en función de los niveles de madurez y el análisis del bucle de retroalimentación"],"fr":["Évaluation du support de référentiel pour le développement d''IA autonome","Identification des lacunes dans les piliers techniques pour le développement assisté par IA","Priorisation des corrections en fonction des niveaux de maturité et de l''analyse de la boucle de rétroaction"],"de":["Bewertung der Repository-Unterstützung für die autonome KI-Entwicklung","Identifizierung von Lücken in den technischen Pfeilern für die KI-gestützte Entwicklung","Priorisierung von Korrekturen basierend auf Reifegradstufen und Feedback-Schleifenanalyse"],"pt":["Avaliando suporte de repositório para desenvolvimento autônomo de IA","Identificando lacunas nos pilares técnicos para desenvolvimento assistido por IA","Priorizando soluções com base nos níveis de maturidade e análise do loop de feedback"],"ru":["Оценивая поддержку репозитория для автономного развития ИИ","Выявляя пробелы в технических столпах для разработки с помощью ИИ","Определяя приоритеты исправлений на основе уровней зрелости и анализа цикла обратной связи"],"ar":["تقييم دعم المستودع لتطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقل","تحديد الفجوات في الركائز الفنية لتطوير معزز بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديد الأولويات للصلح بناءً على مستويات النضج وتحليل حلقة التغذية الراجعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires repository access for analysis","Limited to evaluating nine predefined technical pillars","Dependent on accurate maturity level assessment for effective prioritization"],"zh":["需要存储库访问权限进行分析","仅限于评估九个预定义的技术支柱","依赖于准确的成熟度级别评估以实现有效的优先排序"],"ja":["分析のためにリポジトリアクセスが必要","9つの事前に定義された技術的柱のみを評価すること","効果的な優先順位付けのために正確な成熟度レベル評価に依存する"],"ko":["분석을 위해 리포지토리 액세스 권한이 필요함","9개의事前に 정의된 기술적 기둥만 평가함","유효한 우선 순위 설정을 위해 정확한 성숙도 수준 평가에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio para el análisis","Limitado a la evaluación de nueve pilares técnicos predefinidos","Dependiente de una evaluación precisa de los niveles de madurez para una priorización efectiva"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel pour l''analyse","Limité à l''évaluation de neuf piliers techniques prédéfinis","Dépend d''une évaluation précise des niveaux de maturité pour une priorisation efficace"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Repository für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Bewertung von neun vordefinierten technischen Pfeilern","Abhängig von einer genauen Bewertung der Reifegradstufen für eine effektive Priorisierung"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório para análise","Limitado à avaliação de nove pilares técnicos predefinidos","Dependente de avaliação precisa do nível de maturidade para priorização eficaz"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию для анализа","Ограничен оценкой девяти предопределенных технических столпов","Зависит от точной оценки уровня зрелости для эффективной определения приоритетов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المستودع للتحليل","محدود بتقييم تسعة ركائز فنية محددة مسبقًا","يعتمد على تقييم دقيق لمستوى النضج للترتيب الفعال"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"732c594cf3859aafa281c104a09b6c6ad896014924258a7ab6012b7279156503","qualityScore":36}');
