ds for debugging CI failures with GitHub Actions","Provides quick commands for monitoring PR checks via gh pr checks","Supports viewing run details with gh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_request","Utilizes bash for execution, including options like --watch and --interval","Works with GitHub Actions for automated workflow optimization","Includes fail-fast option for efficient error handling"],"zh":["支持 GitHub Actions","提供 CI 失败调试功能","监控 PR 检查","查看运行详情","支持 gh 命令行工具"],"ja":["GitHub Actions をサポート","CI 失敗のデバッグ機能を提供","PR チェックの監視","実行の詳細を表示","gh コマンドライン ツールをサポート"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 지원","CI 실패 디버깅 기능 제공","PR 확인 監控","실행 세부 정보 보기","gh 명령줄 도구 지원"],"es":["Monitoreo de comprobaciones de PR con gh pr checks","Visualización de detalles de ejecución con gh run list","Compatibilidad con GitHub Actions","Comandos rápidos para depuración de CI","Soporte para intervalos de actualización personalizables"],"fr":["Surveillance des vérifications de PR avec gh pr checks","Affichage des détails d''exécution avec gh run list","Compatibilité avec GitHub Actions","Commandes rapides pour le débogage de CI","Prise en charge des intervalles de mise à jour personnalisables"],"de":["Überwachung von PR-Überprüfungen mit gh pr checks","Anzeige von Ausführungsdetails mit gh run list","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Actions","Quick-Befehle zur Fehlerbehebung von CI","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Aktualisierungsintervalle"],"pt":["Comandos rápidos para monitorar checks de PR","Visualização de detalhes de execução","Integração com GitHub Actions","Suporte a comandos personalizados","Monitoramento de execuções em tempo real"],"ru":["Быстрые команды для мониторинга проверок PR","Просмотр деталей выполнения","Интеграция с GitHub Actions","Поддержка пользовательских команд","Мониторинг выполнений в реальном времени"],"ar":["أوامر سريعة لمراقبة فحوصات PR","تصفح تفاصيل التشغيل","التكامل مع GitHub Actions","دعم الأوامر المخصصة","مراقبة التشغيل في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dart-ci","dart-ci setup guide","github actions troubleshooting","ci/cd pipeline optimization","dart-ci vs github actions","what is dart-ci","dart-ci install","github actions debugging","dart-ci alternative","ci/cd workflow automation"],"zh":["Dart CI/CD","GitHub Actions","CI 失败调试","PR 检查","gh 命令行工具","持续集成","持续部署"],"ja":["Dart CI/CD","GitHub Actions","CI 失敗のデバッグ","PR チェック","gh コマンドライン ツール","継続的インテグレーション","継続的デプロイ"],"ko":["Dart CI/CD","GitHub Actions","CI 실패 디버깅","PR 확인","gh 명령줄 도구","지속적인 통합","지속적인 배포"],"es":["dart-ci","depuración de CI","GitHub Actions","comandos rápidos","integración continua","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","Agente de IA para desarrollo","Herramientas de automatización de CI"],"fr":["dart-ci","débogage de CI","GitHub Actions","commandes rapides","intégration continue","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Agent IA pour le développement","Outils d''automatisation de CI"],"de":["dart-ci","Fehlerbehebung von CI","GitHub Actions","Quick-Befehle","kontinuierliche Integration","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agent für Entwicklung","Automatisierungstools für CI"],"pt":["DART-CI","CI/CD","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","GitHub Actions","Comandos rápidos","Monitoramento de execuções"],"ru":["DART-CI","CI/CD","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки","GitHub Actions","Быстрые команды","Мониторинг выполнений"],"ar":["DART-CI","CI/CD","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","GitHub Actions","أوامر سريعة","مراقبة التشغيل"]}},"owner":"dartsim","repo":"dart","repoPath":"dartsim/dart","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.370Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-ci","description":"DART CI/CD troubleshooting - GitHub Actions, cache debugging, platform-specific failures","bodyPreview":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_re","body":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_request -L 20\ngh run watch <RUN_ID> --interval 30\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json status,conclusion,url\n\n# Debug failures\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --job <JOB_ID> --log-failed\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json jobs --jq ''.jobs[] | {name, databaseId}''\n\n# Rerun failed jobs\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --failed\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --job <DATABASE_ID>\n```\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete CI/CD guide: `docs/onboarding/ci-cd.md`\n\n## Common Failure Modes\n\n| Failure Type         | Solution                                                 |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Formatting fails     | `pixi run lint` then push                                |\n| Codecov patch fails  | Add tests for uncovered lines                            |\n| FreeBSD RTTI fails   | Use type enums + `static_cast` instead of `dynamic_cast` |\n| macOS ARM64 SEGFAULT | Replace `alloca()`/VLAs with `std::vector<T>`            |\n| RTD build fails      | Use defensive `.get(key, default)` patterns              |\n| gz-physics fails     | Reproduce with `pixi run -e gazebo test-gz`              |\n\n## Workflow Architecture\n\n| Workflow            | Purpose                 | Platforms |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------- | --------- |\n| `ci_lint.yml`       | Formatting              | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_ubuntu.yml`     | Build + test + coverage | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_macos.yml`      | Build + test            | macOS     |\n| `ci_windows.yml`    | Build + test            | Windows   |\n| `ci_freebsd.yml`    | Build + test (VM)       | FreeBSD   |\n| `ci_gz_physics.yml` | Gazebo integration      | Ubuntu    |\n\n## Fast Iteration Loop\n\n1. Identify failing step from job logs\n2. Reproduce locally with same build toggles\n3. Fix the smallest failing test\n4. Push and monitor: `gh run watch <RUN_ID>`\n\n## Caching\n\n- sccache/ccache reduces build time 50-70%\n- Check cache hit rates in workflow logs\n- Force cache bust by changing cache key if needed\n\n## Expected CI Times\n\n| Platform | Cached    | Uncached  |\n| -------- | --------- | --------- |\n| Ubuntu   | 20-30 min | 45-60 min |\n| macOS    | 15-25 min | 30-45 min |\n| Windows  | 15-20 min | 25-35 min |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:26.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CI/CD Agents requiring streamlined GitHub Actions debugging and PR check monitoring.","zh":"适合需要简化GitHub Actions调试和PR检查监控的CI/CD代理。","ja":"GitHub ActionsのデバッグとPRチェックの監視を簡素化する必要があるCI/CDエージェントに適しています。","ko":"GitHub Actions 디버깅 및 PR 확인 모니터링을 간소화해야 하는 CI/CD 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que requieren depuración de GitHub Actions simplificada y monitoreo de verificaciones de PR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CI/CD nécessitant un débogage de GitHub Actions simplifié et un suivi des vérifications de PR.","de":"Ideal für CI/CD-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Fehlersuche für GitHub Actions und eine Überwachung von PR-Prüfungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que exigem depuração de ações do GitHub e monitoramento de verificações de PR simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов CI/CD, требующих упрощенную отладку действий GitHub и мониторинг проверок PR.","ar":"مثالي لعميل CI/CD الذي يتطلب تشخيص أخطاء GitHub Actions وتحليل اختبارات PR المبسّطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug CI failures and work with GitHub Actions, providing quick commands for monitoring PR checks and viewing run details using gh commands, enhancing their CI/CD troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理调试CI失败和使用GitHub Actions的能力，提供快速命令用于监控PR检查和使用gh命令查看运行详细信息，从而增强其CI/CD故障排除能力。","ja":"エージェントにCIの失敗をデバッグし、GitHub Actionsを使用する能力を与え、PRチェックを監視し、ghコマンドを使用して実行の詳細を表示するためのクイックコマンドを提供し、CI/CDのトラブルシューティング能力を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 CI 실패를 디버깅하고 GitHub Actions를 사용할 수 있도록 하며, PR 확인을 모니터링하고 gh 명령을 사용하여 실행 세부 정보를查看하는 빠른 명령을 제공하여 CI/CD 문제 해결 능력을增强합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar fallos de CI y trabajar con GitHub Actions, proporcionando comandos rápidos para el monitoreo de verificaciones de PR y la visualización de detalles de ejecución utilizando comandos gh, mejorando sus capacidades de solución de problemas de CI/CD.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer les échecs de CI et de travailler avec GitHub Actions, en fournissant des commandes rapides pour le suivi des vérifications de PR et l''affichage des détails d''exécution à l''aide de commandes gh, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de dépannage CI/CD.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, CI-Fehler zu debuggen und mit GitHub Actions zusammenzuarbeiten, indem sie schnelle Befehle für die Überwachung von PR-Prüfungen und die Anzeige von Ausführungsdetails mithilfe von gh-Befehlen bereitstellen, wodurch ihre CI/CD-Fehlersuche verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar falhas de CI e trabalhar com GitHub Actions, fornecendo comandos rápidos para monitorar verificações de PR e visualizar detalhes de execução usando comandos gh, melhorando suas capacidades de solução de problemas de CI/CD.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отлаживать сбои CI и работать с GitHub Actions, предоставляя быстрые команды для мониторинга проверок PR и просмотра деталей выполнения с помощью команд gh, улучшая их возможности по устранению неполадок CI/CD.","ar":"يتمكّن العملاء من تشخيص أخطاء CI والعمل مع GitHub Actions، ويوفر أوامر سريعة لمراقبة اختبارات PR وعرض تفاصيل التشغيل باستخدام أوامر gh، مما يعزز قدراتهم على حل مشاكل CI/CD."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging CI failures","Monitoring PR checks","Viewing GitHub Actions run details"],"zh":["CI失败调试","PR检查监控","查看GitHub Actions运行详细信息"],"ja":["CIの失敗のデバッグ","PRチェックの監視","GitHub Actionsの実行の詳細の表示"],"ko":["CI 실패 디버깅","PR 확인 모니터링","GitHub Actions 실행 세부 정보查看"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de CI","Monitoreo de verificaciones de PR","Visualización de detalles de ejecución de GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de CI","Suivi des vérifications de PR","Affichage des détails d''exécution de GitHub Actions"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei CI-Fehlern","Überwachung von PR-Prüfungen","Anzeige von Ausführungsdetails von GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de CI","Monitoramento de verificações de PR","Visualização de detalhes de execução de GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев CI","Мониторинг проверок PR","Просмотр деталей выполнения GitHub Actions"],"ar":["تشخيص أخطاء CI","مراقبة اختبارات PR","عرض تفاصيل تشغيل GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions setup","Limited to GitHub platform"],"zh":["需要GitHub Actions设置","仅限于GitHub平台"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsの設定が必要","GitHubプラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 설정이 필요","GitHub 플랫폼만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub Actions","Limitado a la plataforma de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Actions","Limité à la plateforme GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub Actions-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die GitHub-Plattform"],"pt":["Exige configuração de GitHub Actions","Limitado à plataforma GitHub"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Actions","Ограничен платформой GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GitHub Actions","محدود بمنصة GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a2b9639f752d