INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('antorsae/dual-agent/read-task', 'read-task', 'antorsae', 'dual-agent', 'community', 'read-task antorsae dual-agent community The read-task skill enables AI agents to read and execute tasks delegated from Claude Code in a collaborative tmux session, benefiting developers who work with dual-agent environments. Read-Task 技术用于读取和执行 Claude Code 委托的任务，实现双向开发环境 Read-Task は Claude Code から委託されたタスクを読み取り、実行し、双方向開発環境を実現します Read-Task 기술은 Claude Code에서 위임된 작업을 읽고 실행하여 쌍방향 개발 환경을 구현합니다 El skill read-task permite la lectura y ejecución de tareas delegadas desde Claude Code en un entorno de desarrollo dual con Codex CLI Le skill read-task permet la lecture et l''exécution de tâches déléguées depuis Claude Code dans un environnement de développement dual avec Codex CLI Das read-task-Skill ermöglicht das Lesen und Ausführen von Aufgaben, die von Claude Code in einer dualen Entwicklungsumgebung mit Codex CLI delegiert werden O Read-Task é uma habilidade que permite executar tarefas delegadas do Claude Code em uma sessão colaborativa do tmux, utilizando o Codex CLI. Read-Task - это навык, который позволяет выполнять задачи, делегированные из Claude Code в среде разработки с ИИ Агентами, используя Codex CLI. مهام القراءة هي مهارة تسمح بتنفيذ المهام الموكلة من Claude Code في جلسة تعاونية من tmux، باستخدام Codex CLI. how to use read-task read-task setup guide read-task alternative read-task vs Codex collaborative development environment tmux session management Claude Code integration Codex CLI tutorial dual-agent development best practices Read-Task 双向开发环境 Claude Code Codex CLI tmux 自动化开发 AIエージェント 开发工具 Resolves the .agent-collab directory for seamless file operations Utilizes bash commands for directory resolution and task execution Supports collaborative development via tmux sessions Pairs Claude Code with Codex CLI for efficient task delegation Enables task execution outside the project root directory read-task is a skill that facilitates collaborative development by pairing Claude Code with Codex CLI in a tmux session, enabling efficient task execution and delegation.');
